{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34103","headline":"杂体诗 奉和鲁望晓起回文 · 皮日休","name":"杂体诗 奉和鲁望晓起回文","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤烟晓起初原曲，碎树微分半浪中。\n湖後钓筒移夜雨，竹傍眠几侧晨风。\n图梅带润轻沾墨，画藓经蒸半失红。\n无事有杯持永日，共君惟好隐墙东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34103.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34103","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}